#: templates/users/advanced.html:54
msgid ""
"Proxy artwork from approved metadata providers through Floppy so browsers "
"and API clients do not need direct access to those providers. Cached images "
"use disk space and are removed automatically after 30 days without access."
msgstr ""
"Leite Bilder zugelassener Metadatenanbieter über Floppy weiter, damit "
"Browser und API-Clients nicht direkt auf diese Anbieter zugreifen müssen. "
"Zwischengespeicherte Bilder belegen Speicherplatz und werden nach 30 Tagen "
"ohne Zugriff automatisch entfernt."

#: templates/users/advanced.html:58
msgid "Cached images"
msgstr "Zwischengespeicherte Bilder"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:62
msgid "Disk usage"
msgstr "Speicherbelegung"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:67
msgid ""
"Only known provider image hosts are cached (including TMDB, TVDB, "
"MyAnimeList, IGDB, Open Library, Hardcover, ComicVine, BoardGameGeek, "
"MusicBrainz, Pocket Casts, iTunes, Kitsu, and AniList). Manual URLs, local "
"services, placeholders, and unknown hosts stay unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Nur Bilder bekannter Anbieter werden zwischengespeichert (darunter TMDB, "
"TVDB, MyAnimeList, IGDB, Open Library, Hardcover, ComicVine, BoardGameGeek, "
"MusicBrainz, Pocket Casts, iTunes, Kitsu und AniList). Manuelle URLs, lokale"
" Dienste, Platzhalter und unbekannte Hosts bleiben unverändert."

#: templates/users/advanced.html:79
msgid "Enable external image caching"
msgstr "Zwischenspeichern externer Bilder aktivieren"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:92
msgid "Clear Image Cache"
msgstr "Bildercache leeren"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:97
msgid "Only a superuser can change this setting or clear the cache."
