msgid ""
"Permanently delete every tracked entry for one media type in your account, "
"including its progress, ratings, notes, and history. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Lösche alle erfassten Einträge einer Medienart in deinem Konto dauerhaft, "
"einschließlich Fortschritt, Bewertungen, Notizen und Verlauf. Dies lässt "
