msgid "You are about to permanently delete every tracked"
msgstr "Du löschst dauerhaft alle erfassten Einträge der Medienart"

#: templates/users/advanced.html:443
msgid ""
"entry in your account. This removes its progress, ratings, notes, and "
"history."
msgstr ""
"in deinem Konto. Fortschritt, Bewertungen, Notizen und Verlauf werden dabei "
"entfernt."

#: templates/users/advanced.html:448
msgid ""
"For music this covers your whole library page: the followed artists and "
